    "body": "This might be solvable better with compositional tools for events such as [this proposal](https://github.com/whatwg/dom/issues/544) as yeah it doesn't really extend to multiple events well, but compositional tools (e.g. Observable) extend to many patterns rather than trying to work around these event issues on a case-by-case basis.",
